max-visits: 60
is-card: true
card-image: img/flags.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: party_affairs

= Campaigning

Whether or not we are in the middle of an election, the coalition is always trying to broaden its voter base. Who should we focus our organizing efforts on?

- @working_class: The working class, our traditional base.
- @college_educated: College-educated professionals, an increasingly important part of the coalition.
- @non_college_white: Non-college white voters, who have drifted away from us for decades.
- @black_voters: Black voters, the most loyal part of the coalition.
- @latino_voters: Latino voters, a growing and diverse part of the electorate.
- @suburban: Suburban voters, up for grabs between both parties.
- @rural: Rural voters, who have felt neglected by us in the past.
- @root: We either don't want to or cannot campaign right now.
- @easy_discard

@working_class
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: working_class_dem += 6*(1-dissent); working_class_dem -= 2 if unemployed >= 8; working_class_dem -= 2 if unemployed >= 12; working_class_dem += 6*(1-dissent) if jobs_program_implemented = 1; working_class_dem += 3*(1-dissent) if labor_law_reform >= 1; resources -= 1;

We have increased our organizing among the working class. [? if unemployed >= 8: The elevated unemployment rate makes our campaign more difficult. ?][? if jobs_program_implemented = 1 : A federal jobs guarantee gives us a powerful, concrete rallying point. ?][? if labor_law_reform >= 1 : Our record on labor law makes this pitch land harder. ?]

@college_educated
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: college_educated_dem += 6*(1-dissent); college_educated_dem -= 3 if socialism <= 25 and dem_soc_program == 0; resources -= 1; college_educated_dem += 3*(1-dissent) if climate_policy >= 1;

We have increased our organizing among college-educated professionals. [? if socialism <= 25 and dem_soc_program == 0 : Without a clearly articulated program, some in this group remain wary of anything that sounds too radical. ?][? if climate_policy >= 1 : Our record on climate makes this pitch land harder with this group. ?]

@non_college_white
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: non_college_white_dem += 5*(1-dissent); non_college_white_dem -= 3*(1-dissent) if polarization >= 60; resources -= 1; non_college_white_dem += 3*(1-dissent) if working_class_qol >= 105;

We have increased our organizing among non-college white voters. [? if polarization >= 60 : High levels of national polarization make this pitch harder - many in this group have sorted firmly into the other coalition. ?][? if working_class_qol >= 105 : Visible material gains for working people help cut through the noise here. ?]

@black_voters
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: black_voters_dem += 4*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; black_voters_dem -= 3 if voting_rights_reform < 0; black_voters_dem += 4*(1-dissent) if voting_rights_reform >= 1;

We have increased our organizing among Black voters, already the most loyal part of the coalition. [? if voting_rights_reform < 0 : Rollbacks to voting rights protections have made turnout organizing more difficult. ?][? if voting_rights_reform >= 1 : Our record defending voting rights makes this pitch land harder. ?]

@latino_voters
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: latino_voters_dem += 5*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; latino_voters_dem -= 4*(1-dissent) if immigration_enforcement >= 2; latino_voters_dem += 4*(1-dissent) if immigration_reform >= 1;

We have increased our organizing among Latino voters. [? if immigration_enforcement >= 2 : Aggressive immigration enforcement under the current administration makes this pitch more difficult. ?][? if immigration_reform >= 1 : Our record on immigration reform makes this pitch land harder. ?]

@suburban
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: suburban_dem += 5*(1-dissent); suburban_dem -= 3*(1-dissent) if dem_soc_program == 1 and radicalization >= 6; resources -= 1;

We have increased our organizing among suburban voters. [? if dem_soc_program == 1 and radicalization >= 6 : Some in this group are wary of the coalition's more radical rhetoric, which makes this pitch more difficult. ?]

@rural
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: rural_dem += 5*(1-dissent); rural_dem -= 3*(1-dissent) if dem_soc_program == 0; resources -= 1; rural_dem += 3*(1-dissent) if jobs_program_implemented = 1;

We have increased our organizing among rural voters. [? if dem_soc_program == 0 : We have not historically campaigned much in rural areas, and trust here is low. ?][? if jobs_program_implemented = 1 : A federal jobs guarantee is a message that lands well in rural communities hit hard by deindustrialization. ?]
